# Markdown Heading Spacing

When creating or editing Markdown files, surround every ATX heading (`#` through `######`) with exactly one blank line when adjacent content exists.

```markdown
<!-- Incorrect -->
## Goal
Describe the objective.

<!-- Correct -->
## Goal

Describe the objective.
```

This prevents markdownlint `MD022/blanks-around-headings` warnings. Do not insert an unnecessary trailing blank line after a final heading at end of file.
